cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pólya Pipeline in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Pólya Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Counts and generates the distinct derivatives of an aromatic molecule obtained by
  replacing ring CH groups with other atoms, using Pólya's enumeration theorem, with
  IUPAC position numbering and 3D geometries / Gaussian 16 inputs for every derivative.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jorge
    family-names: Tena Martínez
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Pólya enumeration theorem
  - aromatic derivatives
  - symmetry
  - cheminformatics
  - RDKit
  - Gaussian
